From 6596c8fa5421390f7ae2f1cc4add87310400d002 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anisetti Avinash Krishna <anisetti.avinash.krishna@intel.com>
Date: Fri, 29 May 2026 13:16:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix OTA flow in updater_sample application

Make SystemUpdaterSample stable on production images by staging local
OTAs to /data/ota_package for update_engine access, tightening
manifest/UI handling, and adding missing config/error handling.

Tracked-On: NIACP3-1352
Signed-off-by: Anisetti Avinash Krishna <anisetti.avinash.krishna@intel.com>
